Constructor

Special class member

Constructor is automatically called when an object is created
the constructor is NOT considered a method

Has no return type (not even void)

Example:

Restaurant.java

public class Restaurant {
   private String name;
   private int rating;

   public Restaurant() {  // Constructor with no arguments
      name = "NoName";    // Default name: NoName indicates name was not set
      rating = -1;        // Default rating: -1 indicates rating was not set
   }

   public void setName(String restaurantName) {
      name = restaurantName;
   }

   public void setRating(int userRating) {
      rating = userRating;
   }

   public void print() {
      System.out.println(name + " -- " + rating);
   }
}

